#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:2
msgid "Distributed PD Disaggregation on Ascend"
msgstr "Ascend 上的分布式 PD 分离"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:4
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:6
msgid ""
"This document demonstrates how to implement P2P distributed PD "
"disaggregation on Ascend using UCM and Mooncake. In this architecture, "
"UCM is used to implement prefix cache on Prefill nodes for KV cache "
"reuse, while Mooncake handles the transfer of KV cache from Prefill "
"instances to Decode instances."
msgstr ""
"本文档演示如何在 Ascend 平台上，使用 UCM 和 Mooncake 实现 P2P 分布式 PD 分离。"
"在该架构中，UCM 用于在 Prefill 节点上实现前缀缓存以实现 KV 缓存复用，而 "
"Mooncake 负责将 KV 缓存从 Prefill 实例传输到 Decode 实例。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:8
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:10
msgid ""
"vLLM-ascend: Refer to the [vLLM-ascend installation "
"documentation](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/installation.html"
"#set-up-using-docker)."
msgstr ""
"vLLM-ascend：请参阅 [vLLM-ascend 安装文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/installation.html"
"#set-up-using-docker)。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:11
msgid "UCM: Installed with reference to the Installation documentation."
msgstr "UCM：参照安装文档进行安装。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:12
msgid ""
"Mooncake: Mooncake is the serving platform for Kimi, a leading LLM "
"service provided by Moonshot AI. Installation and Compilation Guide"
":[kvcache-ai/Mooncake](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake?tab=readme-"
"ov-file#build-and-use-binaries). Starting from vLLM-ascend version "
"0.11.0, Mooncake is pre-installed in the official vLLM-ascend image, so "
"manual installation is no longer required."
msgstr ""
"Mooncake：Mooncake 是 Kimi 的服务平台，Kimi 是 Moonshot AI 提供的领先 LLM 服"
"务。安装与编译指南：[kvcache-ai/Mooncake](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake?tab=readme-"
"ov-file#build-and-use-binaries)。从 vLLM-ascend 0.11.0 版本起，Mooncake 已预装"
"在官方 vLLM-ascend 镜像中，因此不再需要手动安装。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:15
msgid "PD Disaggregation for MoE Models"
msgstr "MoE 模型的 PD 分离"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/distributed_pd.md:17
msgid ""
"Running MoE models typically requires enabling data parallelism. This "
"section demonstrates a 1P1D example with external load balancing for data"
" parallelism. For questions regarding external load balancing data "
"parallelism, please refer to the vLLM official documentation: [Data "
"Parallel Deployment of external Load "
"Balancing](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/data_parallel_deployment"
"/#external-load-balancing). In this demonstration, both the Prefill "
"instance and Decode instance use DP4TP4 as their parallelism strategy. "
"Assume a total of 4 A2 servers with IPs 192.168.10.1-192.168.10.4."
msgstr ""
"运行 MoE 模型通常需要启用数据并行。本部分演示了一个使用外部负载均衡进行数据并"
"行的 1P1D 示例。有关外部负载均衡数据并行的问题，请参阅 vLLM 官方文档：[外部"
"负载均衡的数据并行部署](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/data_parallel_deployment"
"/#external-load-balancing)。在本演示中，Prefill 实例和 Decode 实例均采用 "
"DP4TP4 作为其并行策略。假设共有 4 台 A2 服务器，IP 为 192.168.10.1-"
"192.168.10.4。"

